save('index.html','Together for a Better Society','MATES Foundation brings people together through education, scholarships, community support, health, emergency assistance and skills development.',f'''<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> PEOPLE AT THE HEART OF CHANGE</span><h1>Together for a<br><em>Better Society.</em></h1><p>A better tomorrow begins with how we care for one another today. Together, we can open doors, lift each other up and create opportunities that last.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="initiatives.html">Explore our initiatives <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="get-involved.html">Be part of the change <span>→</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="note-line"></span><span>One shared purpose.<br><strong>A world of possibilities.</strong></span></div></div><div class="hero-visual">{art}<div class="floating-note"><span class="tiny-icon">{icon('people')}</span><div>Small acts. Shared purpose.<br><strong>Stronger communities.</strong></div></div><span class="art-caption">GROWING A BETTER TOMORROW, TOGETHER</span></div></div></section><section class="purpose-strip"><div class="wrap"><span>EDUCATION</span><b>✦</b><span>COMPASSION</span><b>✦</b><span>OPPORTUNITY</span><b>✦</b><span>COMMUNITY</span></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE SPIRIT OF MATES</span><h2>A helping hand.<br>An open door.<br><em>A shared future.</em></h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">We believe a better society is something we build together.</p><p>MATES Foundation is a charitable foundation with a simple purpose: to bring people together for the good of society. Our initiatives connect education, care and practical opportunity with a spirit of community.</p><p>From supporting a learner’s next step to standing beside someone in difficult times, our vision begins with dignity, inclusion and a willingness to help.</p><a class="text-link" href="about.html">Get to know MATES <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section pale" id="initiatives"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">MATES INITIATIVES</span><h2>Six ways to make<br><em>a meaningful difference.</em></h2></div><p>Different needs. One shared commitment.<br>Explore the areas at the heart of our vision.</p></div><div class="program-grid">{''.join(card(p) for p in programs)}</div><p class="section-footnote">Our focus areas are introduced here. Specific activities, eligibility and participation arrangements will be shared as each program is established.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap approach-grid"><div class="approach-art"><span class="outline-word">WE</span><span class="outline-word filled">CARE.</span><div class="little-label">WITH PEOPLE. FOR PEOPLE.</div></div><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</span><h2>Meaningful change<br>starts with <em>listening.</em></h2><div class="steps"><div><span>01</span><div><h3>Understand the need</h3><p>Listen to people and communities with respect and an open mind.</p></div></div><div><span>02</span><div><h3>Bring people together</h3><p>Connect willing hands, shared knowledge and practical resources.</p></div></div><div><span>03</span><div><h3>Build lasting opportunity</h3><p>Focus on thoughtful support that helps people take their next step.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section involvement"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">THERE’S A PLACE FOR YOU HERE</span><h2>Your time. Your skills.<br><em>Your willingness to care.</em></h2><div class="involvement-grid"><a href="get-involved.html#volunteer"><span>01 / GIVE YOUR TIME</span><h3>Become a volunteer <b>↗</b></h3><p>Bring your energy and compassion to a shared purpose.</p></a><a href="get-involved.html#partner"><span>02 / SHARE YOUR STRENGTHS</span><h3>Partner with MATES <b>↗</b></h3><p>Explore how your organisation can help create opportunity.</p></a><a href="get-involved.html#support"><span>03 / HELP US GROW</span><h3>Support an initiative <b>↗</b></h3><p>Find a meaningful way to contribute to the foundation’s vision.</p></a></div></div></section>''')
save('about.html','Who we are','Discover the purpose and values of MATES Foundation.',intro('WHO WE ARE','A better society begins<br>with <em>all of us.</em>','MATES Foundation brings people together around a shared belief: care, education and opportunity can help communities thrive.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</span><h2>Together for a<br><em>Better Society.</em></h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">A simple motto. A meaningful responsibility.</p><p>Our vision is a society where people feel supported, learning is encouraged and opportunities are within reach. MATES Foundation brings this vision into focus through six complementary initiatives.</p><p>We see community as a shared responsibility. Everyone has something to offer: time, knowledge, practical skills or a willingness to stand beside someone else.</p></div></div></section><section class="section pale" id="values"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT GUIDES US</span><h2>Our values, <em>in practice.</em></h2><div class="values-grid"><article><span>01</span><h3>Dignity</h3><p>See the person first. Treat every individual with care and respect.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Inclusion</h3><p>Welcome different experiences and make space for people to participate.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Compassion</h3><p>Listen carefully and respond thoughtfully to the needs of others.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Responsibility</h3><p>Be thoughtful about commitments and clear about what we can offer.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow"><span class="eyebrow">BUILDING WITH CARE</span><h2>Trust begins with <em>clarity.</em></h2><p>This website introduces MATES Foundation’s purpose and initiative areas. Program details, governance information and official contact channels will be added as they are confirmed.</p><p>No registration status, tax-deductibility, partnerships or delivered outcomes are claimed on this website. We believe these details should be shared accurately and transparently.</p><a class="text-link" href="initiatives.html">Explore our six initiatives ↗</a></div></section>''')
save('initiatives.html','MATES Initiatives','Explore MATES Foundation’s six initiatives for a better society.',intro('MATES INITIATIVES','Many ways to help.<br><em>One shared purpose.</em>','Education, care and opportunity belong together. These six areas guide the foundation’s vision for a better society.')+f'<section class="section pale"><div class="wrap"><div class="program-grid">{"".join(card(p) for p in programs)}</div><p class="section-footnote">Initiative descriptions express our intended focus. Active programs, dates and eligibility will be announced when confirmed.</p></div></section>')
for p in programs:
 s,n,name,tag,desc,short,ic,focus,txt=p
 body=intro('MATES INITIATIVES / '+n,tag.replace('.', '<em>.</em>'),desc)
 body+=f'<section class="section"><div class="wrap detail-grid"><div><span class="detail-icon">{icon(ic)}</span><h2>{name}</h2><p class="large-copy">{txt}</p><h3>Our intended focus</h3><ul class="focus-list">'+''.join('<li>'+f+'</li>' for f in focus)+'</ul></div><aside class="info-panel"><span class="eyebrow">BE PART OF THE PURPOSE</span><h3>A helping hand can<br>open a new door.</h3><p>Interested in volunteering, sharing expertise or supporting this initiative?</p><a class="button" href="contact.html?initiative='+s+'">Express your interest ↗</a><p class="small-note">Specific program activities, availability and eligibility are still to be confirmed. An expression of interest is not an application or a guarantee of assistance.</p></aside></div></section>'
 if s=='health':body+='<div class="wrap notice">Health activities and blood donation must be coordinated through appropriately qualified and authorised providers. This website does not provide medical advice or donor eligibility assessment.</div>'
 if s=='emergency':body+='<div class="wrap notice">This initiative is not an emergency response service. If someone is in immediate danger, contact the emergency services in your location. Do not use this website to request urgent assistance.</div>'
 body+='<section class="section pale"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">EXPLORE MORE</span><h2>Connected by <em>a common purpose.</em></h2><div class="program-grid">'+''.join(card(q) for q in programs if q[0]!=s)+'</div></div></section>'
 save(s+'.html',name,desc,body)
save('get-involved.html','Get involved','Volunteer, partner or support MATES Foundation’s vision for a better society.',intro('GET INVOLVED','A better tomorrow<br>needs <em>people like you.</em>','There are many ways to contribute. Start with what you can offer, and explore where it could make a difference.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="wrap participation"><article id="volunteer"><span class="eyebrow">01 / GIVE YOUR TIME</span><h2>Volunteer <em>with purpose.</em></h2><p>You may be a teacher, student, professional or someone who simply wants to help. Share the skills, interests and time you could bring to MATES.</p><ul class="focus-list"><li>Learning and mentoring</li><li>Community activities and coordination</li><li>Communications, technology and practical skills</li></ul><a class="button" href="contact.html?interest=volunteer">Explore volunteering ↗</a></article><article id="partner"><span class="eyebrow">02 / CREATE OPPORTUNITY</span><h2>Stronger <em>in partnership.</em></h2><p>Community groups, educational organisations, businesses and professionals can bring valuable knowledge and resources. Let’s explore a shared purpose.</p><ul class="focus-list"><li>Share professional knowledge</li><li>Collaborate on an initiative</li><li>Offer resources or learning opportunities</li></ul><a class="button" href="contact.html?interest=partner">Start a partnership conversation ↗</a></article><article id="support"><span class="eyebrow">03 / HELP US GROW</span><h2>Support what <em>matters to you.</em></h2><p>Choose an initiative that connects with your values. Support can include time, expertise, educational materials or other useful resources.</p><div class="notice">Online donations are not available yet. Verified donation arrangements and any applicable tax information will be published once confirmed. This website does not collect payments.</div><a class="button" href="contact.html?interest=support">Discuss ways to support ↗</a></article></div></section>''')
save('contact.html','Contact & expressions of interest','Prepare an expression of interest in MATES Foundation.',intro('LET’S CONNECT','Every good connection<br>starts with <em>hello.</em>','Interested in the foundation, an initiative or a way to help? Prepare a short introduction to share with the MATES team.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</span><h2>Tell us where<br><em>you’d like to help.</em></h2><p>Official email, telephone and social channels will be published here once confirmed.</p><div class="contact-note"><h3>Prepare your introduction</h3><p>Use this form to create a message you can copy or download. It stays in your browser and is not sent to the foundation.</p></div><p class="small-note">Please do not include medical, financial or other sensitive personal information. For urgent help, contact the appropriate services in your location.</p></div><form id="interest-form"><div class="form-row"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" placeholder="Full name"></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200" placeholder="you@example.com"></label></div><label>I’m interested in<select name="interest"><option value="General enquiry">General enquiry</option><option value="Volunteering">Volunteering</option><option value="Partnership">Partnership</option><option value="Supporting an initiative">Supporting an initiative</option>'''+''.join(f'<option value="{p[0]}">{p[2]}</option>' for p in programs)+'''</select></label><label>Your message<textarea name="message" rows="6" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="A little about you and how you’d like to get involved…"></textarea></label><p class="small-note">By preparing a message, you understand that nothing is submitted or sent through this website.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare my message <span>↗</span></button><div id="message-result" hidden aria-live="polite"><h3>Your message is ready</h3><p>This has not been sent. Save it until an official contact channel is available.</p><textarea id="prepared-message" rows="9" readonly aria-label="Prepared message"></textarea><div class="actions"><button type="button" id="copy-message" class="button small">Copy message</button><button type="button" id="download-message" class="text-link">Download text ↓</button></div><p id="copy-status" role="status"></p></div></form></div></section>''')
save('privacy.html','Privacy & website information','How the MATES Foundation website handles information.',intro('WEBSITE INFORMATION','Clear information.<br><em>Thoughtful choices.</em>','Privacy, accessibility and information about this website.')+'''<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow prose"><h2>Your privacy</h2><p>This website does not provide accounts, accept payments or send form submissions. The contact page prepares a message locally in your browser. Information entered there is not transmitted to the foundation and is not saved by the website.</p><p>If you download a prepared message, that file is stored on your device. If you copy it, it is placed on your clipboard. Take care when sharing personal information.</p><h2>Hosting and cookies</h2><p>This website is hosted using GitHub Pages. The hosting provider may process technical information, including IP addresses and request logs, as part of providing the service. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub’s privacy statement</a> for its practices. This website does not add analytics, advertising trackers or tracking cookies.</p><p>Optional typefaces load from Google Fonts. Your browser may connect to Google to retrieve those font files; system fonts are used if they are unavailable.</p><h2>Program information</h2><p>Initiatives describe the foundation’s intended areas of focus. Program availability, eligibility, dates, governance, registration details and donation arrangements should be confirmed through official announcements when available.</p><h2>Accessibility</h2><p>The site supports keyboard navigation, readable text, responsive layouts and reduced motion preferences. If you encounter a barrier, please report it through an official contact channel once available.</p><h2>Logo and content</h2><p>The MATES Foundation logo is used as supplied. Written content introduces the foundation’s purpose and does not claim verified activity or impact beyond the information provided.</p></div></section>''')
